-121-rulin"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m011-0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"老子","kind":"person","person_id":"iwu_5oj_dcv","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:p011","chapter_id":"c-shiji-121-rulin"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m011-0013","start":13,"end":15,"surface":"老子","kind":"person","person_id":"iwu_5oj_dcv","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:p011","chapter_id":"c-shiji-121-rulin"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:p008","text":"蘭陵王臧既受詩，以事孝景帝為太子少傅，免去。今上初即位，臧乃上書宿衛上，累遷，一歲中為郎中令。及代趙綰亦嘗受詩申公，綰為御史大夫。綰、臧請天子，欲立明堂以朝諸侯，不能就其事，乃言師申公。於是天子使使束帛加璧安車駟馬迎申公，弟子二人乘軺傳從。至，見天子。天子問治亂之事，申公時已八十餘，老，對曰：「為治者不在多言，顧力行何如耳。」是時天子方好文詞，見申公對，默然。然已招致，則以為太中大夫，舍魯邸，議明堂事。太皇竇太后好老子言，不說儒術，得趙綰、王臧之過以讓上，上因廢明堂事，盡下趙綰、王臧吏，後皆自殺。申公亦疾免以歸，數年卒。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m008-0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"王臧","kind":"person","person_id":"jh5_a7h_pvv","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m008-0010","start":10,"end":13,"surface":"孝景帝","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m008-0022","start":22,"end":24,"surface":"今上","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m008-0028","start":28,"end":29,"surface":"臧","kind":"person","person_id":"jh5_a7h_pvv","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m008-0034","start":34,"end":35,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m008-0049","start":49,"end":51,"surface":"趙綰","kind":"person","person_id":"8dt_22t_v15","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m0